<title>UK: Daimler sees H2 profit at least equal to H1.</title>
<headline>Daimler sees H2 profit at least equal to H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz AG management chairman Juergen Schrempp said on Thursday that he expects the group's second half profit to be at least as high as profits in the first half.</p>
<p>Daimler had earlier reported that group net profit climbed to 782 million marks in the first half of 1996 from a loss of 1.573 billion marks in the first half of last year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
